    sj "[mc]... obrigado."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc3.rpy:2998
translate brazil ch6sc3_791d6bd1:

#   sj "What we just shared, it means everything to me. I do not regret it."
    sj "O que acabamos de compartilhar significa tudo para mim. Não me arrependo."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc3.rpy:2999
translate brazil ch6sc3_554d5c43:

#   sj "But we cannot act like this in front of the others... no matter how badly we want to, okay?"
